  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Agroforestal Sostenible</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Agroforestry Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos del programa son: (i) incrementar los ingresos de los pequeos productores a travs de mayor productividad agrcola; y (ii) aumentar la sostenibilidad ambiental y adaptacin al cambio climtico a travs del mejor manejo del capital natural. El objetivo especfico es mejorar la conectividad a los mercados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s objectives are to: (i) increase the income of small farmers through higher agricultural productivity; and (ii) enhance environmental sustainability and adaptation to climate change through better natural capital management. Its specific objectives is to improve connectivity with markets.</narrative>
  </description>
